TITLE:: RCDurList
summary:: An editable list of durations driving a beat
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCBeat, Classes/RCRhythm

DESCRIPTION::
Installed by code::beat.set(\dur, [1, 0.5, Rest(0.5)])::. Element edits take effect immediately (Pseq reads lazily), structural edits at the next loop.

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: removeHit
Turn the hit at a position (wrapped) into a rest.
argument:: pos
METHOD:: addHit
Insert a hit at a time from the loop start, splitting the hit or rest that contains it.
argument:: durFromStart
METHOD:: totalDur
Set: truncate or extend the loop (fixes the proto-library's index-shifting removal).
METHOD:: duplicate
argument:: copies
METHOD:: array
METHOD:: size
